  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade for Development Portfolio Review</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Trade for Development Portfolio review will undertake a complete review of all Aid for Trade programming since 2015. It will develop a database tool, that allows us to have an overview of all Aid for Trade programmes currently being delivered by the UK Government and delivered by the UK Government since 2015. It will also produce a narrative analysis report that summarises the portfolio, identifies gaps, identifies key lessons learned across the portfolio and analyses how aligned the portfolio is with best practice and strategic objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
